            <title>[LU-21084] conf-sanity test_32c: repeated ZFS upgrade fails list verification</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21084</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;conf-sanity test_32c fails list verification while upgrading disk2_15-zfs.tar.bz2 with DNE. On the repeated image upgrade, ls -Rni in striped_dir_old reports:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;ls: cannot access './init.d/functions': No such file or directory&lt;br/&gt;
ls: cannot access './init.d/README': No such file or directory&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The diff removes their expected inode/stat records and adds question-mark records, followed by FAIL: list verification failed.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;CI session: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/02f1dcaf-b1e0-4d88-b0c3-814aacc1761f" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/02f1dcaf-b1e0-4d88-b0c3-814aacc1761f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Test set: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/7408fe27-8214-43a9-9678-e2d719c85e4a" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/7408fe27-8214-43a9-9678-e2d719c85e4a&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
The preceding session ece93441-3ee9-44ed-ae28-d6a0211133a0 fails identically. Both sessions pass the first iteration and fail on disk2_15-zfs in the second. All three images run; change 70263's single-image selection is inactive.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Comparison on Rocky 9.7, kernel 5.14.0-611.55.1.el9_7_lustre, ZFS 2.4.0, two MDTs and two OSTs on one node:&lt;br/&gt;
ONLY_REPEAT=2 CLEANUP_DM_DEV=false ./auster -r -s conf-sanity --only 32c&lt;br/&gt;
With revision 1253d3537962: first iteration PASS (210s), second FAIL (183s), same listing error.&lt;br/&gt;
Replacing only conf-sanity.sh with its branch parent 40b80bc048 while keeping identical binaries and configuration: FAIL (182s), same two missing files. The parent run followed the pinned run after cleanup and removal of leftover dm-flakey mappings. These small counts establish reproduction without the patch, not a fleet-wide failure rate. The 30-day DNE ZFS normal review group has 2/2340 failures, both timeouts, so its aggregate rate does not describe this repeated-subtest configuration.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The existing links &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-16968" title="conf-sanity test_32c: FAIL: Mounting the MDT " class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-16968"&gt;LU-16968&lt;/a&gt; (MDT mount failure) and &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18652" title="conf-sanity test_32b: FAIL: verify quota failed" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-18652"&gt;LU-18652&lt;/a&gt; (quota verification) do not match. &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-15751" title="Interop conf-sanity test_32b: Fails list verification with missing permissions" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-15751"&gt;LU-15751&lt;/a&gt; describes an older 2.12-client interop failure involving an unmounted OST, which does not match this same-version run. Searches for list verification, striped_dir_old and repeated 32c found no matching ticket.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Raised by Patch Watcher run pw-engineer-70263-ps4-b696f146d692 on &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/70263" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/70263&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
